        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Río Grande de Santiago River\n- People: Felipe de Jesús Calderón Hinojosa\n- Roles: President of Mexico\n- Events: dam completion, dam inauguration\n\nFacts:\n- A dam on the Río Grande de Santiago River was completed in June 2012.\n- Felipe de Jesús Calderón Hinojosa served as President of Mexico from 2006 to 2012.\n- Felipe de Jesús Calderón Hinojosa inaugurated the dam on the Río Grande de Santiago River after its completion in June 2012.",
