        "original_id": "0f3b4688-a31b-5927-8e17-abecb44fc8ee",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Felipe Calderón\n- Places: La Yesca, Mexico\n- Infrastructure: La Yesca Dam, El Cajón Dam, Grande de Santiago River\n- Events: dam completion, dam inauguration, presidency\n\nFacts:\n- Felipe Calderón was born on 18 August 1962.\n- Felipe Calderón served as President of Mexico from 1 December 2006 to 30 November 2012.\n- El Cajón Dam, downstream of La Yesca on the Grande de Santiago River, was completed in 2007.\n- La Yesca Dam at La Yesca on the Grande de Santiago River was completed in 2012.\n- President Felipe Calderón inaugurated La Yesca Dam on 6 November 2012.",
